Henry (whistles)

00:10:51.444 --> 00:10:53.068
(laughs loudly)

00:10:53.068 --> 00:10:54.697
Hi, hi Scott.

00:10:54.697 --> 00:10:55.530
Hi Scott.

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:56.619
Okay I think my--

00:10:56.619 --> 00:11:00.020
- I would have grabbed my
doggy, but he's sleeping.

