00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:39.740
You had dog poop, that was awesome.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:40.740
Okay, one more.

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:41.750
Okay, here we go.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:43.010
