00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:50.173
- No.

00:12:50.173 --> 00:12:52.240
- I had no chance in hell, that's awesome.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:54.340
Hey, thank you so much.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:57.620
